---
// src/pages/about/_components/AboutTeam.astro
import Section from '../../../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section height={800} class="py-10 md:py-20 lg:py-32 bg-cream-50 border-t border-emerald-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-700 block mb-3"
        >The People Behind It</span
      >
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-6 tracking-tight">
        A small team with <br /><em class="font-serif italic text-emerald-700 font-medium"
          >an unreasonably large mission.</em
        >
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-emerald-900/80 font-medium">
        We are parents, educators, and technologists. Every person on this team either felt this
        problem personally or has dedicated their career to solving it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div
        class="bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-700 to-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-3xl mx-auto mb-5 shadow-inner"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          OF
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-1">Faisal Khan</h3>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Founder & CEO
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-emerald-900/80 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Former product lead at an EdTech startup. Father of two. Built Quranific because he
          couldn't find what his family needed. Reads every parent feedback note personally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-700 to-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-3xl mx-auto mb-5 shadow-inner"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          SA
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-1">Sara Ahmed</h3>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Head of Education
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-emerald-900/80 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Former primary school teacher turned Islamic education specialist. Holds an MA in
          Educational Psychology. Designed Quranific's entire pedagogical framework.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-white border border-emerald-100 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300"
      >
        <div
          class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-600 to-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-serif text-3xl mx-auto mb-5 shadow-inner"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          KR
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-1">Khaled Rashid</h3>
        <div class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Head of Teachers
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-emerald-900/80 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Hafiz with 15 years of teaching experience across three countries. Personally conducts
          every teacher vetting interview. Has approved fewer than 20% of applicants.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
